1
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:07,660
=Bionic Trace=

2
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:10,620
=Episode 6=

3
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:13,160
That day, he told me backstage

4
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,560
that none of us needs to be perfect.

5
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:16,800
But you know what?

6
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:18,680
In every interview, he says

7
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:19,520
if you're not perfect,

8
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:21,040
you don't deserve to be on stage.

9
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:23,520
But the person I met backstage that day

10
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:25,520
couldn't have been fake.

11
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:27,240
And I even

12
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:29,400
gave him a hug.

13
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,680
Could it be

14
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:34,360
that the real Li Senyao

15
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:36,000
has been replaced by an android?

16
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:50,080
Well, isn't this our celebrity,
Qiu Lulu?

17
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,080
Why are you still making a fool

18
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,520
of yourself after taking
a leave from school?

19
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,150
(Bullying ringleader:)
Even a little mouse has made a friend.

20
00:02:13,150 --> 00:02:14,080
(An, Qiu Lulu's classmate)
Even a little mouse has made a friend.

21
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,620
(Bullying participant:
Wei, Qiu Lulu's classmate)

22
00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:20,280
Don't tell me

23
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:22,920
you're also one of that
Senyao guy's obsessed fans.

24
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:25,320
Because of her,

25
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,720
I got a major disciplinary warning.

26
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,480
And I blame

27
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,600
every bit of it

28
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:31,200
on Qiu Lulu.

29
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,800
Going to bully someone again?

30
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:35,200
What if someone records you
and posts it online,

31
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:36,800
and some young idol

32
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,400
reposts it to expose you?

33
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:40,680
Wouldn't the principal expel you?

34
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:41,880
Don't remind me.

35
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,880
It's all because of her.

36
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,360
Those fans of his

37
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:49,160
really need to be taught a lesson.

38
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,800
Then this time,

39
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:53,040
we won't post it online.

40
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:55,240
We'll just share it among ourselves.

41
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:56,800
How about that?

42
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,760
No.

43
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:02,880
Song Yang.

44
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:04,640
Hack the campus surveillance
cameras for me.

45
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:07,520
That could easily expose your location.

46
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:09,360
Oh, fine.

47
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,360
(You can make your move now.)

48
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:12,120
Thanks.

49
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:12,960
Looks like

50
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,160
your new friend

51
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:15,640
wants nothing to do with you.

52
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:23,800
You're not touching her today.

53
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,120
You have a death wish?

54
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,480
My phone!

55
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,560
Okay.

56
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:42,280
Lulu.

57
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:43,760
Give me the phone.

58
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,320
I was wrong.

59
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,560
Please stop filming me.

60
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:58,520
Who are you?

61
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,440
What year are you in?

62
00:04:00,440 --> 00:04:01,280
Do you know what consequences

63
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,160
this could have for us?

64
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:04,080
Have you heard
of the broken windows theory?

65
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:06,680
If one broken window is left unfixed,

66
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,080
soon all the other windows

67
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,080
will be broken, too.

68
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:11,520
If you don't apologize to Qiu Lulu,

69
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:14,360
I'll post this video online.

70
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:16,160
That will serve as a warning to everyone

71
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:17,840
and show them

72
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:19,440
that you can be bullied, too.

73
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:21,760
I'm sure I don't need to explain

74
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:23,600
what that would mean for you.

75
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:26,280
I was wrong.

76
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,840
I'm sorry. I was wrong.

77
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:29,560
I was wrong. I really was.

78
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,840
Say it to Qiu Lulu.

79
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:32,520
Qiu Lulu.

80
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:33,480
I was wrong. Please forgive me.

81
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,400
Will you?

82
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:35,240
I'm really sorry.

83
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:35,920
Qiu Lulu.

84
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,240
Please forgive me.

85
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,680
I was wrong.

86
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:59,440
I didn't get a chance to ask earlier.

87
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:01,360
What's your name?

88
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,920
You can call me Ada.

89
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:05,040
Thank you, Ada.

90
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,360
I never knew

91
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,640
I could stand up for myself.

92
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:09,840
It's not too late to learn.

93
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:13,160
Ada.

94
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:15,960
Does the X22 model

95
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,680
have combat capabilities?

96
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:18,840
(I just downloaded)

97
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:20,880
(tutorial videos on 12 fighting styles)

98
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:22,640
(and mastered them in two seconds.)

99
00:05:27,440 --> 00:05:29,240
Both her ability to learn independently

100
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,720
and her emotional module

101
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:32,040
are getting stronger.

102
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:34,120
She's evolving.

103
00:05:34,200 --> 00:05:35,520
(Digital analysis complete.)

104
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:40,920
It's not a shortened link

105
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:43,600
or a database security key.

106
00:05:44,660 --> 00:05:45,700
(Password cracking rules)

107
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:48,800
I see.

108
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:51,320
It's a set of rules
for decoding encrypted videos.

109
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,680
Let me try again.

110
00:05:57,340 --> 00:06:00,020
(ACCESS DENIED. RETRY PASSWORD.)

111
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,680
There's another layer
of password protection.

112
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:08,720
Let me see.

113
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:12,840
If my guess is right,

114
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:16,440
Qiu Lulu...

115
00:06:16,700 --> 00:06:17,220
(ACCESS AUTHORIZED)

116
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:18,520
Ada.

117
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,600
I did it!

118
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,360
I've decrypted a video.

119
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:22,920
It should finish loading any second now.

120
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:23,920
(Received.)

121
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:37,120
Captain Deng, we've got something.

122
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:44,120
These are the server activity logs

123
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,160
of a private company.

124
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,000
Just now,

125
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:47,800
a series of suspicious

126
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,560
external access attempts
appeared on their server.

127
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:50,840
Our system

128
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:52,880
automatically detected the activity.

129
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,080
It's

130
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,960
a talent agency.

131
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,000
Fans of celebrities

132
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,800
try to hack into

133
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,120
their servers all the time.

134
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:05,600
What does that have
to do with the police?

135
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:07,560
The company isn't the point.

136
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,080
It's the hacker.

137
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,600
I just took a look.

138
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:11,920
Although this time,

139
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,560
he used a private access key,

140
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:14,760
the code he used

141
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:16,160
to break in is interesting.

142
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,000
It has his distinctive style.

143
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,600
Song Yang?

144
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,040
Look, Captain Deng.

145
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,640
We've finally found a lead on him.

146
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,280
The server logs show

147
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,720
he's still in there,

148
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,480
looking for something.

149
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:31,760
Excellent.

150
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:32,600
This is our chance.

151
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,840
Start tracking him immediately.

152
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:34,520
Okay.

153
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:57,360
Trying to catch me?

154
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:59,440
Not even close.

155
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:02,680
Looks like I need a little more time.

156
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:04,880
I'll lead them around a bit longer.

157
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,440
Let's try this.

158
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,760
We've got him occupied.

159
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:19,040
We're analyzing and decoding
his digital traces.

160
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,880
We should be able to locate

161
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:22,160
his hideout very soon.

162
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:27,520
Song Yang

163
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:29,480
has always been so careful.

164
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:34,760
Why would he make

165
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:36,120
such a basic mistake?

166
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:41,560
We've got him.

167
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:44,920
We're about to pinpoint his location.

168
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,560
His hideout is at

169
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:51,000
(No. 7 Yulin West Road)

170
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,320
No. 7 Yulin West Road?

171
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:54,480
That's the police station's address.

172
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:57,440
The traces he left behind

173
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:58,160
were bait.

174
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:59,200
He tricked us.

175
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:00,480
You're a police officer.

176
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,360
Watch your language.

177
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:03,080
Can you find him again?

178
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:05,760
I'll try.

179
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:10,040
He's already left the server.

180
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,720
He's deleted

181
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,760
every trace of his access.

182
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,240
We've lost him.

183
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:19,560
How frustrating.

184
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,600
Too slow.

185
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:24,960
Once I've cleared my name,

186
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:27,280
I'm definitely applying to be a
consultant in the Cybersecurity Division

187
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,800
and teaching them a thing or two.

188
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:32,840
(Video loaded.)

189
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:37,040
Ada, can you hear me?

190
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,640
The video has loaded successfully.

191
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:40,320
It's an unaccompanied vocal rehearsal.

192
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,840
(Let Qiu Lulu watch it.)

193
00:09:42,040 --> 00:09:42,720
Received.

194
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,800
Send it to me.

195
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,560
You seem

196
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:48,720
to be on the phone a lot.

197
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:49,400
Who is it?

198
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,000
A friend.

199
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:52,720
I just asked him to help me

200
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,120
decode that string of numbers.

201
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,760
It seems to be a video.

202
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,040
A video?

203
00:09:57,040 --> 00:10:00,990
♪The sound of cicadas stretches down
the corridor of summer♪

204
00:10:01,310 --> 00:10:04,950
♪My shadow quietly follows behind you♪

205
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:07,240
This is...

206
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,760
It's Senyao.

207
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,800
I've never heard this song before.

208
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:13,520
Is this an unreleased song of his?

209
00:10:13,540 --> 00:10:18,250
♪In that bookstore,
you love the corner by the window♪

210
00:10:18,610 --> 00:10:22,320
♪So I leave my entire afternoon there♪

211
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:25,200
He used those

212
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,160
numbers

213
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:27,480
to send me

214
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,840
one of his unreleased songs.

215
00:10:31,070 --> 00:10:34,770
♪Waiting for the bell
that ends your classes to ring out♪

216
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:38,710
♪Waiting for you to pass by my window♪

217
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:40,840
But

218
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:44,040
doesn't he sound

219
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,600
a little off?

220
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,290
He seems to be singing offbeat.

221
00:10:47,290 --> 00:10:50,040
♪My secret love is a silent star♪

222
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:51,640
That's not really a mistake

223
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:52,720
a professional singer would make.

224
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:53,640
Could it be because

225
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:55,440
it was his first time
recording the rehearsal?

226
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:58,570
♪Even if you never
turned around to see me♪

227
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,600
Come on. Let's go somewhere.

228
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:01,880
Where?

229
00:11:13,570 --> 00:11:20,670
♪I'm the one who's broken♪

230
00:11:21,680 --> 00:11:26,390
♪Calm, ordinary, and reckless♪

231
00:11:26,590 --> 00:11:29,460
♪That's me, too♪

232
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:34,520
♪Carefully sketching
and shaping every detail♪

233
00:11:35,350 --> 00:11:38,610
♪Laughter and tears make life feel real♪

234
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:43,060
♪Don't fear that it's not worth it.
Just be brave♪

235
00:11:43,550 --> 00:11:46,000
♪And learn from your mistakes♪

236
00:11:47,890 --> 00:11:50,560
♪If the human heart
is impossible to fathom♪

237
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:52,810
♪Could selling my soul and body♪

238
00:11:52,810 --> 00:11:55,980
♪Bring me something more?♪

239
00:11:56,600 --> 00:12:03,410
♪Stroke by stroke,
I draw the perfect outline♪

240
00:12:04,190 --> 00:12:07,510
♪Sadness is blue♪

241
00:12:08,620 --> 00:12:11,860
♪How would you paint me?♪

242
00:12:12,860 --> 00:12:16,590
♪Layering, crossing, blending endlessly♪

243
00:12:16,590 --> 00:12:18,630
♪Painting without restraint♪

244
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:21,630
♪Covering the person I used to be♪

245
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:25,580
♪If I could start over♪

246
00:12:25,990 --> 00:12:29,890
♪I'd show more feeling
in every look and gesture♪

247
00:12:29,890 --> 00:12:32,540
♪Give me back my smile♪

248
00:12:33,100 --> 00:12:35,590
♪Find joy even in hardship♪

249
00:12:36,170 --> 00:12:41,150
♪Don't let the next version of me
be left with nothing♪
